  "context": "Today inventory listing is `POST /v1/units` with an `InventoryFilterDto` body, offset-paged via Spring `Pageable` (`page`/`size`/`sort`), returning `PageInventoryUnitsDto`. Offset paging degrades on deep pages. **Decision:** add a `/v2` with cursor paging in a new `rest/v2` package; `/v1` untouched. **Blast radius:** inventory-backend controller + response DTO, platform-frontend consumer. No data, event, or ES change. *(V2* names are proposed — no `rest/v2` exists yet.)*",
